<title>USA: Ek Chor China Motorcycle year shr falls.</title>
<headline>Ek Chor China Motorcycle year shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.20		    $1.23</p>
<p> Net			  3,400		   21,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,098		   17,098</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Ek Chor China Motorcycle Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said it was being adversely affected by the &quot;difficult market conditions&quot; in the Chinese motorcycle industry, resulting primarily from an oversupply of motorcycles.</p>
</text>
